<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><Regulation lims:pit-date="2026-09-25" lims:lastAmendedDate="2026-09-25" lims:current-date="2026-09-30" lims:inforce-start-date="2026-09-25" lims:enacted-date="2026-09-25" lims:fid="1599258" lims:id="1599258" gazette-part="II" regulation-type="SI" xml:lang="en" xmlns:lims="http://justice.gc.ca/lims"><Identification lims:inforce-start-date="2026-09-25" lims:enacted-date="2026-09-25" lims:fid="1599259" lims:id="1599259"><InstrumentNumber>SI/2026-55</InstrumentNumber><RegistrationDate><Date><YYYY>2026</YYYY><MM>10</MM><DD>7</DD></Date></RegistrationDate><ConsolidationDate><Date><YYYY>2026</YYYY><MM>10</MM><DD>1</DD></Date></ConsolidationDate><EnablingAuthority lims:inforce-start-date="2026-09-25" lims:enacted-date="2026-09-25" lims:fid="1599260" lims:id="1599260"><XRefExternal reference-type="act" link="F-11">FINANCIAL ADMINISTRATION ACT</XRefExternal></EnablingAuthority><LongTitle lims:inforce-start-date="2026-09-25" lims:enacted-date="2026-09-25" lims:fid="1599261" lims:id="1599261">Order in Council Directing that the Annual Report of the Canadian Nuclear Safety Commission and the Annual Report of the Canada Energy Regulator Board of Directors Be Discontinued</LongTitle><RegulationMakerOrder><RegulationMaker>P.C.</RegulationMaker><OrderNumber>2026-867</OrderNumber><Date><YYYY>2026</YYYY><MM>9</MM><DD>25</DD></Date></RegulationMakerOrder></Identification><Order lims:inforce-start-date="2026-09-25" lims:enacted-date="2026-09-25" lims:fid="1599262" lims:id="1599262"><Provision lims:inforce-start-date="2026-09-25" lims:enacted-date="2026-09-25" lims:fid="1599263" lims:id="1599263" format-ref="indent-0-0" hyphenation="no" language-align="yes" list-item="no"><Text>Whereas it appears to the Governor in Council that the annual report of the Canadian Nuclear Safety Commission, required by section 72 of the <XRefExternal reference-level="federal" reference-type="act" link="N-28.3">Nuclear Safety and Control Act</XRefExternal><FootnoteRef idref="fn_81000-2-6252_hq_1783025560">a</FootnoteRef> to be laid before both Houses of Parliament, and the annual report of the Canada Energy Regulator Board of Directors, required by subsection 18(1) of the <XRefExternal reference-level="federal" reference-type="act" link="C-15.1">Canadian Energy Regulator Act</XRefExternal><FootnoteRef idref="fn_81000-2-6252_hq_1783025605">b</FootnoteRef> to be laid before both Houses of Parliament, contain the same information as or less information than is contained in the Public Accounts or in any estimates of expenditures submitted to Parliament;</Text><Footnote id="fn_81000-2-6252_hq_1783025560" placement="page" status="official"><Label>a</Label><Text>S.C. 1997, c. 9</Text></Footnote><Footnote id="fn_81000-2-6252_hq_1783025605" placement="page" status="official"><Label>b</Label><Text>S.C. 2019, c. 28, s. 10</Text></Footnote></Provision><Provision lims:inforce-start-date="2026-09-25" lims:enacted-date="2026-09-25" lims:fid="1599264" lims:id="1599264" format-ref="indent-0-0" hyphenation="no" language-align="yes" list-item="no"><Text>Therefore, Her Excellency the Governor General in Council, on the recommendation of the Minister of Natural Resources, under section 157<FootnoteRef idref="fn_81000-2-6252_hq_1783025859">c</FootnoteRef> of the <XRefExternal reference-level="federal" reference-type="act" link="F-11">Financial Administration Act</XRefExternal><FootnoteRef idref="fn_81000-2-6252_hq_1783025892">d</FootnoteRef>, directs that the annual report of the Canadian Nuclear Safety Commission, required by section 72 of the <XRefExternal reference-level="federal" reference-type="act" link="N-28.3">Nuclear Safety and Control Act</XRefExternal><FootnoteRef idref="fn_81000-2-6252_hq_1783025560">a</FootnoteRef> to be laid before both Houses of Parliament, and the annual report of the Canada Energy Regulator Board of Directors, required by subsection 18(1) of the <XRefExternal reference-level="federal" reference-type="act" link="C-15.1">Canadian Energy Regulator Act</XRefExternal><FootnoteRef idref="fn_81000-2-6252_hq_1783025605">b</FootnoteRef> to be laid before both Houses of Parliament, be discontinued.</Text><Footnote id="fn_81000-2-6252_hq_1783025859" placement="page" status="official"><Label>c</Label><Text>S.C. 1991, c. 24, s. 47</Text></Footnote><Footnote id="fn_81000-2-6252_hq_1783025892" placement="page" status="official"><Label>d</Label><Text>R.S., c. F-11</Text></Footnote></Provision></Order></Regulation>